// P-PACK: `@packed` is a value-`struct` layout marker; on a class it is a misplacement (E0054).
// It reported E0038 until the codes were unified — but E0038 is the code for a packed type's
// *field* constraints, a different fault about a different subject.
// expect: error E0054 at 6:2
// expect: exit 1
@packed class Boxed { value: int }
echo "unreached"
